			title: "Sleep One Night, Then Follow Pip to the Inn"
			subtitle: "The Hearth has gone out."
			icon: "minecraft:campfire"
			description: ["Pip, at your door, out of breath: \"The Hearth's out! It's been out since supper and Aunt Marnie is just standing there looking at it!\"", "", "Sleep one night in your own bed, then walk down the hill to the inn. Everyone in the valley is already inside it.", "", "Opens the winter book and hands you 64 Firewood Bundles, a winter cloak and Marnie's cocoa."]
