			description: ["Bram: \"Mill makes it, Works needs it, duct in between. You have done this once already.\"", "", "Run Energy Duct from the mill to the Works, then install 2 Thermal Energy Cells at the Works end of the line.", "", "The Works has power — which is what everything from here to the reactor runs on. It still is not yours: Josie left it to whoever the valley trusts, and the valley counts that in people. Six of eight, when you get there."]
