			icon: "biggerreactors:reactor_casing"
			description: ["Bram: \"Shell, terminal, fuel rods, control rods, an access port and two coolant ports — build it square. Her drawing's on the wall behind you.\"", "", "Gather 64 Reactor Casings, 1 Reactor Terminal, 8 Reactor Fuel Rods, 4 Reactor Control Rods, 1 Reactor Access Port and 2 Reactor Coolant Ports, then assemble the vessel on the marked pad in the Works — four rod columns two rods tall, and one coolant port on each long face, water in one side and steam out the other. Without the pair it runs passive and the turbine never sees steam.", "", "Computer port, redstone port, Josie's blueprint framed above it — and four more pages of Josie's Turbine Notes, which the next quest reads."]
