			description: ["Tobin, calm for once: \"Fuel, coolant, rods — I check them, I sign it, Bram pulls it. That's the order, and I wrote it down twice.\"", "", "Open the Reactor Terminal in the Works and verify all three readings — fuel level, coolant flow, control-rod insertion — then tell Tobin the numbers are good and hand Bram the lever.", "", "Forty lamps. Fifteen people. One winter that nobody leaves.", "", "Tonight the valley keeps its own lights on, and it does not need anybody in this room to stay awake to do it."]
